            "text": "<p><em>Engineered for the ultimate suspension, </em></p><ul><li><strong>GVM Increase:</strong> 3850kg (approx. 1272kg payload). GCM Increase 8050 KG ZR2 or 8350 LTZ</li><li><strong>Key Features:</strong> Premium <strong>Fox 2.5 DSC (Dual Speed Compression)</strong> adjustable shocks.</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> Heavy-duty touring. If you have a, bull bar, and a heavy tow ball weight from a large caravan, this is your sweet spot without having to upgrade your wheel and tyre package.<br/></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The DSC adjustability allows you to \"dial in\" your ride—stiffen it for the highway and soften it for the tracks at the turn of a knob. Fox’s premium shocks setup for the Chevy Silverado 1500.<br/><br/></p>"
